Conclusion
The global rack mount CDU market is poised for substantial growth over the next decade, driven by the insatiable demand for computing power from AI, HPC, and cloud services. While challenges around cost and complexity remain, the clear energy efficiency advantages of liquid cooling are accelerating adoption across all data center segments, from hyperscale to edge computing facilities.
As technology continues to advance and economies of scale drive down costs, rack mount CDUs will become an increasingly standard component of data center infrastructure, much like air conditioning did in the previous era. The future points toward more integrated, efficient, and intelligent cooling solutions that will support the next generation of computing.
